      "body": "\r\n\r\n## Purpose\r\n\r\nAddresses the MiniMax M2 part of #57827. When the model closes `</invoke>` without closing the final `</parameter>`, final conversion drops that tool argument. This change preserves the trailing argument while keeping earlier complete arguments intact.\r\n\r\nAdds non-streaming and streaming regression tests for this case.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nRun the focused parser suite:\r\n\r\n`VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=cpu .venv/bin/python -m pytest --confcutdir=tests/parser/engine tests/parser/engine/test_minimax_m2.py -v`\r\n\r\nRun the repository's commit hooks.\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\n- 16 parser tests passed, including both new regression tests. The run emitted 14 Torch JIT deprecation warnings.\r\n- All applicable commit hooks passed, including Ruff, mypy, and test tethering.\r\n- No model evaluation was run. This post-generation text conversion is covered by CPU-only parser tests.\r\n---\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Essential Elements of an Effective PR Description Checklist</summary>\r\n\r\n- [x] Purpose and related issue described.\r\n- [x] Test command provided.\r\n- [x] Test results provided.\r\n- [x] Documentation considered; no update needed for this parser-only fix.\r\n</details>",
